display_type="Integer"	;	The values are "Integer", "Decimal", "Bool", and "Percent"
show_inverted="true"	;
negative_preferred="true";	For item comparisons sometimes lower is better.

display_group: Used for the compare function. i.e. groupConsumables are not compared against groupRanged
